{"id":"0b6b8966305e02a9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-regular-rotation-graph.md","title":"带端口的有限正则无向多重图","display":"df-regular-rotation-graph — 带端口的有限正则无向多重图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph","aliases":["28-df-regular-rotation-graph"],"display":"df-regular-rotation-graph — 带端口的有限正则无向多重图","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"§21.1 and §21.3.1; printed pp.422–423,434; PDF pp.448–449,460","source_printed_pages":"422–423,434","source_pdf_pages":"448–449,460","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-regular-rotation-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-regular-rotation-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-rotation-graph — 带端口的有限正则无向多重图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§21.1 and §21.3.1; printed pp.422–423,434; PDF pp.448–449,460"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"422–423,434"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"448–449,460"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(N,D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[q]=\\{1,\\ldots,q\\}\">\\([q]=\\{1,\\ldots,q\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\)</span> 为有序对的投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{id}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{id}_A\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的恒等函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 由下式约束。顶点为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[N]\">\\([N]\\)</span>，每顶点的端口为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[D]\">\\([D]\\)</span>；自环端口计入度数一次。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v\\in[N]\">\\(u,v\\in[N]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[D]\">\\(i\\in[D]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\\subseteq[N]\">\\(S,T\\subseteq[N]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RG}\">\\(\\mathsf{RG}\\)</span> 是图的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nbr}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{nbr}_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_G\">\\(m_G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_G\">\\(E_G\\)</span> 是下式引入的函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\coloneqq\\{(N,D,R):R:[N]\\times[D]\\to[N]\\times[D]\\land R\\circ R=\\mathrm{id}_{[N]\\times[D]}\\},\\qquad \\mathsf{RG}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{N,D\\ge1}\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\coloneqq\\{(N,D,R):R:[N]\\times[D]\\to[N]\\times[D]\\land R\\circ R=\\mathrm{id}_{[N]\\times[D]}\\},\\qquad \\mathsf{RG}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{N,D\\ge1}\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\Longrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{nbr}_G(v,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_1(R(v,i)),\\\\\nm_G(u,v)&amp;\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[D]:\\operatorname{nbr}_G(v,i)=u\\}|,\\\\\nE_G(S,T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v,i)\\in S\\times[D]:\\operatorname{nbr}_G(v,i)\\in T\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\Longrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{nbr}_G(v,i)&amp;\\coloneqq\\pi_1(R(v,i)),\\\\\nm_G(u,v)&amp;\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[D]:\\operatorname{nbr}_G(v,i)=u\\}|,\\\\\nE_G(S,T)&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(v,i)\\in S\\times[D]:\\operatorname{nbr}_G(v,i)\\in T\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\Longrightarrow\\left[\\forall u,v\\in[N]\\quad m_G(u,v)=m_G(v,u),\\qquad\n\\forall v\\in[N]\\quad\\sum_{u=1}^N m_G(u,v)=D\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[G\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\Longrightarrow\\left[\\forall u,v\\in[N]\\quad m_G(u,v)=m_G(v,u),\\qquad\n\\forall v\\in[N]\\quad\\sum_{u=1}^N m_G(u,v)=D\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旋转映射把一条边的两个端口相互交换，故要求对合，而不仅是任意置换。固定端口表示一个自环；同一对顶点可由多个端口相连。对合给出端口之间的双射，从而得到乘数对称性；端口按终点分组得到每列总数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>。这与本书第21章允许自环和重边的模型对应，不复用只含简单无向图的 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dada5c223e508373\" href=\"?note=dada5c223e508373\" title=\"28-df-finite-graph\">28-df-finite-graph</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_G(S,T)\">\\(E_G(S,T)\\)</span> 计数从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 发出的有向端口；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,T\">\\(S,T\\)</span> 不交，每条跨边恰计一次；若重叠，两端都在交集的非自环计两次。这明确化了 mixing lemma 中重叠集合时的边计数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=1\">\\(N=1\\)</span>、重边及固定自环均可使用同一构造。新建前搜索本书原子名及第21章相关内容，未见兼容的端口多重图接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-finite-graph","status":"resolved","id":"dada5c223e508373","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"旋转映射把一条边的两个端口相互交换，故要求对合，而不仅是任意置换。固定端口表示一个自环；同一对顶点可由多个端口相连。对合给出端口之间的双射，从而得到乘数对称性；端口按终点分组得到每列总数 $D$。这与本书第21章允许自环和重边的模型对应，不复用只含简单无向图的 [[28-df-finite-graph]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N,D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"[q]=\\{1,\\ldots,q\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1,\\pi_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{id}_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"[N]","display":false},{"tex":"[D]","display":false},{"tex":"u,v\\in[N]","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[D]","display":false},{"tex":"S,T\\subseteq[N]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nbr}_G","display":false},{"tex":"m_G","display":false},{"tex":"E_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\coloneqq\\{(N,D,R):R:[N]\\times[D]\\to[N]\\times[D]\\land R\\circ R=\\mathrm{id}_{[N]\\times[D]}\\},\\qquad \\mathsf{RG}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{N,D\\ge1}\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}.","display":true},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\Longrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{nbr}_G(v,i)&\\coloneqq\\pi_1(R(v,i)),\\\\\nm_G(u,v)&\\coloneqq|\\{i\\in[D]:\\operatorname{nbr}_G(v,i)=u\\}|,\\\\\nE_G(S,T)&\\coloneqq\\{(v,i)\\in S\\times[D]:\\operatorname{nbr}_G(v,i)\\in T\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"G\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\Longrightarrow\\left[\\forall u,v\\in[N]\\quad m_G(u,v)=m_G(v,u),\\qquad\n\\forall v\\in[N]\\quad\\sum_{u=1}^N m_G(u,v)=D\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"E_G(S,T)","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S,T","display":false},{"tex":"N=1","display":false}],"bytes":2392,"backlinks":[{"id":"c355ffd617fb7a9d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$E_G(S,T)$ 见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]；$\\rho\\in[0,1]$。$\\operatorname{EdgeExp}(G;\\rho)$ 为组合边扩张谓词。"},{"id":"2ba6c7f35c1a7f30","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$ 采用 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]；$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$v\\in[N]$，$\\vec i=(i_1,\\ldots,i_k)\\in[D]^k$。$\\operatorname{pidx}_{D,k}$ 为下式定义的端口编码；$v_t,j_t$ 依赖当前 $v,\\vec i$，按 $t$ 有限递归。$P_G$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]。"},{"id":"e714f65d9793749d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)$、$H=(M,d,S)$ 分别属于 $\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D},\\mathsf{RG}_{M,d}$，见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]；$a,b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\operatorname{prodidx}_{a,b}$ 是下式构造的编号双射。$P_G,P_H$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]。$u\\in[N],v\\in[M],i\\in[D],j\\in[d]$；$R(u,i)=(u_R,i_R)$、$S(v,j)=(v_S,j_S)$。"},{"id":"1c9d3a0ba202211c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；$\\operatorname{nbr}_G,m_G$ 见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]。$z,w\\in\\mathbb R^N$，$u,v\\in[N]$；矩阵作用于列向量；$I_N$ 为 $N$ 阶恒等矩阵。$[D]^*$ 为有限端口字串集合，$a\\in[D]^*$，$i\\in[D]$；$\\varepsilon$ 为空字串，$a^\\frown i$ 是在末尾附加端口 $i$。$P_G,J_N,u_N,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_N,\\|\\cdot\\|_{1,N},\\|\\cdot\\|_{2,N},\\operatorname{Walk}_G$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"f8284ae43439ae52","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N,D,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$H=(D,d,S)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{D,d}$，见 [[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]。$[a]=\\{1,\\ldots,a\\}$；$u,u'\\in[N]$，$v,v'\\in[D]$，$i,i'\\in[d]$，$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$。\n$P_H$ 见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]；$I_N$ 为 $N$ 阶单位矩阵，$\\otimes$ 为矩阵 Kronecker 积。$\\eta_D,\\zeta,R_\\circledR,\\widehat R$ 由下式定义，所有矩阵行、列均使用 $\\eta_D$ 编号。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：扩展图、游走与提取器：[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]、[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]、[[28-df-spectral-expander]]、[[28-df-edge-expander]]、[[28-df-explicit-expander-family]]、[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]、[[28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma]]、[[28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion]]、[[28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum]]、[[28-thm-expander-walk-extractor]]。"}],"outgoing":["dada5c223e508373"]}